{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11235110","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11235110","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1123511001:1":{"text":"ハサールさん、なんだか前よりも元気そうですね！","source_cn":"哈什尔先生，您看起来精神了不少！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EF2A12E66DA1623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123511002:1":{"text":"はっ、そうか？\nバカ熊どものせいで、おちおち寝込んでいられんからな！","source_cn":"哈，是吗。\\n也许是被那帮笨蛋熊人气的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF23B2D0B340C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1123511002":{"text":"はっ、そうか？\nバカ熊どものせいで、おちおち寝込んでいられんからな！","source_cn":"哈，是吗。\\n也许是被那帮笨蛋熊人气的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDF23B2D0B340C04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123511003:1":{"text":"見ての通り、わしは自分の持てるものすべてを一族に伝えるつもりじゃよ。それが終わるまでは、わしもまだまだ仲間に貢献できそうじゃ。","source_cn":"如你所见，我已经决定要把自己所会的东西在氏族内传承下去...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCD39C54CEA0720DE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"見ての通り、わしは自分の持てるものすべてを一族に伝えるつもりじゃよ。それが終わるまでは、わしもまだまだ仲間に貢献できそうじゃ。","female":"見ての通り、わしは自分の持てるものすべてを一族に伝えるつもりじゃよ。それが終わるまでは、わしもまだまだ仲間に貢献できそうじゃ。","variant_male_record_index":"126250","variant_female_record_index":"126251","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123511004:1":{"text":"あなたの指導は素晴らしい！分かりやすく実用的で、あっという間に問題を解決できたよ。","source_cn":"真是精彩的教导！你讲的话简练实用，